.DS_Store
*.zip
.env
.env.*

# Operator-specific overrides (contain infra endpoints / credentials).
# Track the *.example templates instead.
*.local.env

# Legacy file-based Dogecoin RPC credentials from older releases.
secrets/*/dogecoin_rpc_user
secrets/*/dogecoin_rpc_password

# Node identity private keys (public IDs/enodes are safe to share).
**/discovery-secret
**/l2reth-identity/
**/l2reth-p2p.key
**/nodekey
**/.p2p-key-*
